# Windows batch entry points must land in the working tree with CRLF line
# endings: cmd.exe misparses an LF-only batch file (it executes comment text
# as commands). core.autocrlf=input would otherwise check these out with LF.
# Blobs stay LF in the object store; checkout writes CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
